  "review": "<h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b-2 border-amber-500 pb-2 mb-4\">【2026】由布院（湯布院）といえばコレ！金鱗湖の朝霧・湯の坪街道食べ歩き＆由布岳絶景離れ宿比較</h2>\n\n<div class=\"my-6 p-6 bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-50 via-amber-50/40 to-stone-50 border border-emerald-200 rounded-3xl shadow-sm space-y-3\">\n  <h3 class=\"text-base font-bold text-emerald-950 flex items-center gap-2\">🌄 湖底から温泉が湧く「金鱗湖の朝霧」と湯の坪街道！豊後牛と由布岳の絶景</h3>\n  <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed\">豊後富士と称される由布岳の山麓に広がる全国屈指の憧れ温泉地・由布院。秋から冬の早朝に見られる幻想的な「金鱗湖の朝霧」、食べ歩きが楽しい「湯の坪街道」、とろけるブランド肉「豊後牛」。静寂の雑木林に佇む離れ露天風呂宿で極上の贅沢に浸れます。</p>\n</div>\n\n<h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b border-amber-300 pb-2 my-6 flex items-center gap-2\">🏆 由布院を代表する最高峰名旅館</h2>\n\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-white border border-amber-200/90 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-amber-100 pb-3 mb-4\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-lg\">第1位</span>\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">由布院温泉　ゆふいん月燈庵</h3>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 font-extrabold text-xs rounded-full\">⭐ 3.88</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"mb-4\"><img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/54519/54519.jpg\" alt=\"由布院温泉　ゆふいん月燈庵 外観・客室\" class=\"w-full h-56 object-cover rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n  <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-amber-950 bg-amber-50 p-2.5 rounded-xl mb-3 border border-amber-100\">✨ 約一万坪の敷地に僅か18室の全室離れ露天風呂！築300年の古民家母屋と極上懐石</p>\n  <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\">櫟の雑木林に囲まれた隠れ宿。全室に専用露天風呂を備え、川のせせらぎを聴きながら味わう豊後牛炭火焼き懐石が至高の評価。</p>\n  \n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-2.5 my-3 text-xs\">\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-stone-50 rounded-xl border border-stone-200\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">👤 こんな旅におすすめ：</strong>記念日、ご夫婦、ハネムーン、最高峰の離れ宿を求める人</div>\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-emerald-50/60 rounded-xl border border-emerald-200\"><strong class=\"text-emerald-950\">🎯 選ぶ決め手：</strong>一万坪の自然美と全室離れ客室露天風呂なら迷わずここ！</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"pt-3 text-center\">\n    <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Fhb.afl.rakuten.co.jp%2Fhgc%2F54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583%2F%3Fpc%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fimg.travel.rakuten.co.jp%252Fimage%252Ftr%252Fapi%252Fkw%252FJBe8h%252F%253Ff_no%253D54519\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block w-full md:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 via-amber-600 to-orange-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-2xl shadow-md hover:scale-105 transition transform\">\n      ✈️ 【公式楽天トラベル】由布院温泉　ゆふいん月燈庵 の最新空室・最安値プランを見る\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-white border border-amber-200/90 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-amber-100 pb-3 mb-4\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-lg\">第2位</span>\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">由布院温泉　由布院ことぶき　花の庄</h3>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 font-extrabold text-xs rounded-full\">⭐ 3.69</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"mb-4\"><img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/20591/20591.jpg\" alt=\"由布院温泉　由布院ことぶき　花の庄 外観・客室\" class=\"w-full h-56 object-cover rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n  <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-amber-950 bg-amber-50 p-2.5 rounded-xl mb-3 border border-amber-100\">✨ 約二千坪の日本庭園越しに望む由布岳の雄姿！大浴場露天風呂と豊後牛会席</p>\n  <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\">由布院駅から徒歩5分の好アクセス。広大な日本庭園の池越しに由布岳を一望。手入れの行き届いた庭園散策と豊後水道の鮮魚会席が好評。</p>\n  \n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-2.5 my-3 text-xs\">\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-stone-50 rounded-xl border border-stone-200\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">👤 こんな旅におすすめ：</strong>ファミリー、シニア、由布院駅近と絶景庭園を愛する人</div>\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-emerald-50/60 rounded-xl border border-emerald-200\"><strong class=\"text-emerald-950\">🎯 選ぶ決め手：</strong>由布岳を望む二千坪の日本庭園と駅近立地ならここ！</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"pt-3 text-center\">\n    <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Fhb.afl.rakuten.co.jp%2Fhgc%2F54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583%2F%3Fpc%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fimg.travel.rakuten.co.jp%252Fimage%252Ftr%252Fapi%252Fkw%252FJBe8h%252F%253Ff_no%253D20591\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block w-full md:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 via-amber-600 to-orange-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-2xl shadow-md hover:scale-105 transition transform\">\n      ✈️ 【公式楽天トラベル】由布院温泉　由布院ことぶき　花の庄 の最新空室・最安値プランを見る\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>"
